# FIN-007: Q4 2024 Quarterly Report

**Company:** MedSync Health
**Document ID:** FIN-007
**Reporting Period:** Fourth Quarter and Full Year Ended December 31, 2024
**Currency:** United Arab Emirates Dirham (AED)
**Date of Issue:** January 17, 2025

---

## 1. Executive Summary

MedSync Health concluded the 2024 fiscal year with a strong performance in the fourth quarter, driven by the continued expansion of the MedSync Compliance Suite and robust growth in the North American market. Total revenue for Q4 2024 reached **AED 132,300,000**, contributing to a full-year revenue of **AED 485,100,000**. This represents a 32.0% year-over-year growth compared to FY 2023.

The company successfully closed its Series D funding round in June 2024, raising AED 551,250,000, which has been strategically deployed to accelerate R&D and market penetration. While the company remains in a high-growth, investment phase, the Gross Margin was maintained at a healthy 75.0% for the year. Net Revenue Retention (NRR) stood at an exceptional **118%**, demonstrating strong customer value and successful upselling efforts.

The total headcount grew to 1,200 employees by the end of Q4 2024, a net increase of 100 employees during the quarter, supporting the company's global expansion and product development roadmap.

